@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox

participant "voimed" as Daemon
participant "voime-gpu-firered" as Worker

note over Daemon, Worker
  worker 已 Ready；同一时刻只处理一个 Final
end note

Daemon -> Worker : Transcribe(PCM)
Worker -> Worker : 内部处理

alt 正常完成
  Worker --> Daemon : Result(text)
else 取消
  Daemon -> Worker : Cancel(id)
  Worker --> Daemon : Error（取消）
else 超时
  Daemon -> Worker : 超时终止
end

note over Daemon, Worker
  超时由 daemon 计时；取消与超时只改变边界消息，
  不展开 AED / FireRedPunc 阶段
end note
@enduml
